sequenceDiagram
    participant App as Control Plane
    participant SAI as SAI FRR API

    App->>SAI: create_next_hop_group(type=PROTECTION)
    SAI-->>App: nhg1

    App->>SAI: create_next_hop_group(type=ECMP, hw_protection_backup=true)
    SAI-->>App: nhg2

    rect rgb(230, 244, 234)
    Note over App,SAI: Create next hops for port1 / port2 / port3 (minimal detail)
    App->>SAI: create_next_hop(port1)
    SAI-->>App: nh_1_id
    App->>SAI: create_next_hop(port2)
    SAI-->>App: nh_2_id
    App->>SAI: create_next_hop(port3)
    SAI-->>App: nh_3_id
    end

    App->>SAI: create_next_hop_group_member(nhg1, next_hop=nh_1_id, role=PRIMARY)
    SAI-->>App: nhgm_1_id (member 1 of nhg1)

    App->>SAI: create_next_hop_group_member(nhg1, next_hop=nhg2, role=STANDBY)
    SAI-->>App: nhgm_2_id (member 2 of nhg1)

    App->>SAI: create_next_hop_group_member(nhg2, next_hop=nh_2_id)
    SAI-->>App: nhgm_3_id (member of nhg2)

    App->>SAI: create_next_hop_group_member(nhg2, next_hop=nh_3_id)
    SAI-->>App: nhgm_4_id (member of nhg2)

    Note over App,SAI: nhg1 is now ready: primary=NH1, standby=nhg2[NH2, NH3]
